To seek redemption

261
00:11:59,200 --> 00:12:03,200
I don't understand. You're telling me all this stuff, and it doesn't make any sense to me

262
00:12:04,200 --> 00:12:07,200
Why are we so important? And why would he need to redeem himself?

263
00:12:08,200 --> 00:12:11,200
I can answer your question, but first, there is something that I must ask you

264
00:12:12,200 --> 00:12:16,200
Tell me, Ristarte, do you possess a Goddess's courage to learn the truth?

265
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:23,200
Does he ever listen to a single thing we tell him? I can't deal with this!

266
00:12:24,200 --> 00:12:26,200
This is how he handles everything, isn't it?

267
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:28,200
Do you actually think this is funny, cult?

268
00:12:29,200 --> 00:12:32,200
Relax, Tiana. I'm sure it'll all work out in the end. It always does, right?

269
00:12:33,200 --> 00:12:37,200
Whose side are you on, Arya? I just don't think we should encourage his reckless behavior

270
00:12:38,200 --> 00:12:40,200
Oh, try not to let it get under your skin

271
00:12:41,200 --> 00:12:43,200
Oh, Arya, is that you?

272
00:12:44,200 --> 00:12:45,200
Yes, it is indeed

273
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:50,200
And what we're watching right now is the B-level mission to save a world called Exphoria

274
00:12:51,200 --> 00:12:52,200
Exphoria?

275
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:55,200
Is that Seiya?

276
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:58,200
Alright guys, let's go wipe out the Chimera

277
00:12:59,200 --> 00:13:00,200
Hold on, Seiya, we're not ready

278
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:03,200
The Chimera's level is way higher than ours

279
00:13:04,200 --> 00:13:05,200
We should probably take some more time to train

280
00:13:06,200 --> 00:13:08,200
We don't have time. Sooner we fight, sooner we win

281
00:13:09,200 --> 00:13:10,200
Besides, I've got a strategy

282
00:13:11,200 --> 00:13:13,200
Well, could you please share it with the rest of us?

283
00:13:14,200 --> 00:13:15,200
Yeah, let's do our best

284
00:13:16,200 --> 00:13:17,200
We're fine, relax

285
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:21,200
That's the dumbest thing I've ever heard, that is not a strategy

286
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:24,200
We need to be 100% ready to win no matter what

287
00:13:25,200 --> 00:13:27,200
It's gonna be okay, everything will work out

288
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:30,200
What? We have to take this battle seriously

289
00:13:31,200 --> 00:13:33,200
Wait, Seiya, where are you going? We're not ready!

290
00:13:34,200 --> 00:13:36,200
Seiya! I don't think this is a good idea

291
00:13:37,200 --> 00:13:42,200
Way back then, Seiya Ryuguin was the hero I'd summoned to take control of Exphoria

292
00:13:42,200 --> 00:13:45,200
What? Then why haven't I heard about this before now?

293
00:13:46,200 --> 00:13:48,200
Our mage dressed in the robes was named Colt

294
00:13:49,200 --> 00:13:52,200
The girl, that was Princess Tiana of Exphoria

295
00:13:53,200 --> 00:13:54,200
She was our party's healer

296
00:13:55,200 --> 00:13:58,200
She joined up with Seiya along the way to help defeat the demon lord

297
00:13:58,200 --> 00:13:59,200
Huh?

298
00:14:12,200 --> 00:14:14,200
Colt, use your wind magic!

299
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:16,200
On it! Here goes!

300
00:14:17,200 --> 00:14:19,200
I'll find an opening and finish this in no time

301
00:14:22,200 --> 00:14:23,200
Oh no!

302
00:14:23,200 --> 00:14:24,200
Tiana, I need heals!

303
00:14:25,200 --> 00:14:26,200
Okay, just hold still!

304
00:14:26,200 --> 00:14:28,200
Wait Tiana, you need to heal Seiya first

305
00:14:29,200 --> 00:14:30,200
He's down to his last two HP!

306
00:14:31,200 --> 00:14:32,200
What? Only two?

307
00:14:33,200 --> 00:14:34,200
There's a huge hole in his chest!

308
00:14:35,200 --> 00:14:36,200
Oh, I'll be okay

309
00:14:37,200 --> 00:14:40,200
I know this looks pretty bad, but weirdly enough it doesn't really hurt that much

310
00:14:41,200 --> 00:14:43,200
I'm starting to feel like this is all just a crazy dream

311
00:14:44,200 --> 00:14:45,200
You feel that way because you're about to die!

312
00:14:46,200 --> 00:14:49,200
So hard to believe, he doesn't seem like the Seiya that I know at all

313
00:14:49,200 --> 00:14:52,200
No, although things were looking grim, we still made it through

314
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:02,200
Look at that! We won!

315
00:15:03,200 --> 00:15:06,200
You should look at us instead! We're all in horrible shape right now!

316
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:09,200
Yeah, we have been better, but it's good we beat him

317
00:15:10,200 --> 00:15:12,200
You think this is good? Poor Colt had his leg ripped off!

318
00:15:13,200 --> 00:15:15,200
Tiana, please hurry up and heal me!

319
00:15:16,200 --> 00:15:20,200
Alright you guys, the Golem is our next target, so we better get moving

320
00:15:21,200 --> 00:15:22,200
Hey, did you hear me?

321
00:15:22,200 --> 00:15:24,200
Colt's gonna bloody step where his leg used to be!

322
00:15:26,200 --> 00:15:28,200
So weird, are you sure that's even Master?

323
00:15:29,200 --> 00:15:30,200
He reminds me of Rosalie

324
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:32,200
This is how Seiya used to behave

325
00:15:33,200 --> 00:15:37,200
He hated waiting to level up, all he wanted to do was keep moving forward

326
00:15:38,200 --> 00:15:41,200
He foolishly believed that his innate fighting ability would be enough

327
00:15:41,200 --> 00:15:50,200
Even though his rating was low, and despite the fact that he was never prepared, he always managed to defeat the enemy, so none of us really worried all that much

328
00:15:51,200 --> 00:15:53,200
Sounds to me like he was more fun then

329
00:15:54,200 --> 00:15:59,200
Maybe that old Seiya actually celebrated with his friends after a victory, instead of freaking out about the next fight

330
00:15:59,200 --> 00:16:05,200
We all relied on Seiya in those times, and he relied on us

331
00:16:12,200 --> 00:16:15,200
Seiya, all we gotta do is beat the Demon Lord

332
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:16,200
The Demon Lord

333
00:16:16,200 --> 00:16:20,200
Yeah, and we're headed out first thing tomorrow, you should make sure to get a good night's sleep

334
00:16:21,200 --> 00:16:23,200
Oh, I'm way too nervous to sleep

335
00:16:24,200 --> 00:16:27,200
Hey, are you sure we don't need to go to the Sage's Village?

336
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:33,200
We already have the weapon we need to win, so let's not go out of our way for anything

337
00:16:34,200 --> 00:16:37,200
But we can get some information about the Demon Lord there, according to Aria

338
00:16:37,200 --> 00:16:41,200
I just want to beat the Demon Lord and save the world as soon as I possibly can

339
00:16:42,200 --> 00:16:45,200
You're always in such a massive hurry, aren't you?

340
00:16:46,200 --> 00:16:48,200
You never make time to train or anything like that

341
00:16:49,200 --> 00:16:52,200
Are you ever gonna tell me why it is you're in such a crazy rush?

342
00:16:53,200 --> 00:16:54,200
It's not that complicated

343
00:16:55,200 --> 00:16:56,200
No special reason

344
00:16:57,200 --> 00:16:58,200
Jeez, every time I bring it up, that's all you say

345
00:16:59,200 --> 00:17:01,200
This question's tomorrow, so I gotta know why

346
00:17:02,200 --> 00:17:04,200
What's the real reason? Just tell me

347
00:17:04,200 --> 00:17:14,200
The longer the Demon Lord is alive, the longer the people of this world will suffer

348
00:17:15,200 --> 00:17:16,200
That's all there is to it

349
00:17:17,200 --> 00:17:19,200
That's why we have to end this now

350
00:17:20,200 --> 00:17:22,200
Okay, it's actually a good point

351
00:17:23,200 --> 00:17:25,200
I would never have made it this far without your healing magic

352
00:17:26,200 --> 00:17:27,200
Sorry to keep putting you out

353
00:17:28,200 --> 00:17:29,200
I know that I ask a lot sometimes

354
00:17:30,200 --> 00:17:31,200
It's fine, really

355
00:17:31,200 --> 00:17:33,200
I'm sure things will all work out in the end

356
00:17:34,200 --> 00:17:36,200
So go on and say what you always say

357
00:17:36,200 --> 00:17:38,200
I always feel better after hearing it

358
00:17:41,200 --> 00:17:42,200
It's gonna be okay

359
00:17:43,200 --> 00:17:45,200
Everything will work out

360
00:17:45,200 --> 00:17:47,200
No, no, no, no, no, no.

361
00:18:09,800 --> 00:18:10,800
Way to go!

362
00:18:10,800 --> 00:18:15,240
I'm just in the nick of time.

363
00:18:15,860 --> 00:18:16,660
Is he dead?

364
00:18:17,160 --> 00:18:19,020
The Demon Lord's HP reads zero.

365
00:18:19,340 --> 00:18:20,120
It's over.

366
00:18:20,760 --> 00:18:21,620
Thank goodness.

367
00:18:21,940 --> 00:18:22,360
You see?

368
00:18:22,940 --> 00:18:25,220
It's gonna be okay, like I told you.

369
00:18:25,660 --> 00:18:28,880
I know you said that, but you really didn't have to take things down to the wire.

370
00:18:29,060 --> 00:18:30,120
That was close.

371
00:18:30,600 --> 00:18:31,840
My MP's at zero.

372
00:18:32,160 --> 00:18:32,720
For real.

373
00:18:32,920 --> 00:18:34,780
I'm a goddess and I nearly died.

374
00:18:34,780 --> 00:18:41,560
Colt, no!

375
00:18:52,560 --> 00:18:53,560
That's impossible.

376
00:18:53,880 --> 00:18:55,420
He was dead just a second ago.

377
00:18:55,420 --> 00:19:01,700
Aria, no!

378
00:19:01,880 --> 00:19:03,880
I have the power of an extra life.

379
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:06,740
Take one and I'll race from the dead to have my vengeance.

380
00:19:07,120 --> 00:19:08,140
This can't be happening.

381
00:19:08,540 --> 00:19:10,300
If only do we consult with that sage.

382
00:19:10,420 --> 00:19:11,820
You have to run away right now.

383
00:19:11,940 --> 00:19:12,740
Please, go!

384
00:19:19,740 --> 00:19:21,820
Goddess is a shock full of nutrients.

385
00:19:21,820 --> 00:19:25,080
I feel so much better than I have in years.

386
00:19:26,220 --> 00:19:28,420
Tiana, can you use your restoration magic?

387
00:19:29,460 --> 00:19:30,660
No, I'm sorry.

388
00:19:31,360 --> 00:19:33,220
My magic's all gone.

389
00:19:33,580 --> 00:19:35,040
There's no need to apologize.

390
00:19:35,740 --> 00:19:36,240
Seiya.

391
00:19:36,340 --> 00:19:37,780
You were right about everything.

392
00:19:38,140 --> 00:19:40,040
We should have been better prepared for this.

393
00:19:40,880 --> 00:19:41,400
Run!

394
00:19:44,200 --> 00:19:46,960
I think you'll make a safety law of that girl.

395
00:19:47,160 --> 00:19:47,660
Stop!

396
00:19:48,100 --> 00:19:49,500
Please just let her go!

397
00:19:49,500 --> 00:19:53,380
No, please!

398
00:19:53,780 --> 00:19:54,340
Seiya!

399
00:19:54,780 --> 00:19:55,060
Hmm?

400
00:19:55,420 --> 00:19:56,220
What's this?

401
00:19:56,640 --> 00:20:00,620
I can sense the faintest signs of a new life coming from this woman's belly.

402
00:20:01,400 --> 00:20:04,040
That's your seed growing insider, isn't it?

403
00:20:04,340 --> 00:20:08,160
I think I'll have it for one last appetizer before the main course.

404
00:20:08,460 --> 00:20:13,000
This mother and child will be the perfect sacrifice to usher in a new world.

405
00:20:14,440 --> 00:20:15,520
Please, no!

406
00:20:16,080 --> 00:20:16,600
Stop!

407
00:20:16,840 --> 00:20:17,600
I beg you!

408
00:20:17,600 --> 00:20:19,760
Don't do this!

409
00:20:20,460 --> 00:20:20,940
No!

410
00:20:24,940 --> 00:20:26,580
I believe that we've seen enough.

411
00:20:26,860 --> 00:20:28,160
It wasn't Seiya's fault.

412
00:20:29,280 --> 00:20:29,900
It's mine.

413
00:20:30,700 --> 00:20:33,560
If only we'd gone to the sage's village and learned that secret.

414
00:20:35,060 --> 00:20:37,400
As the goddess, I should have made that happen.

415
00:20:37,600 --> 00:20:38,720
Hey, are you okay?

416
00:20:39,060 --> 00:20:39,400
Rista!

417
00:20:39,400 --> 00:20:45,000
Have the memories that once lay dormant in your soul re-emerged, Ristarte?

418
00:20:45,560 --> 00:20:48,900
The poor princess whose life the hero was unable to save.

419
00:20:49,160 --> 00:20:52,780
That was you, before your rebirth as a goddess of the divine realm.

420
00:20:52,780 --> 00:21:04,560
Thanks to Arya's wish, as well as the good deeds Princess Tiana performed during her life, you were reincarnated as the goddess you are today.

421
00:21:04,560 --> 00:21:09,460
It was no mere coincidence that you chose Seiya to bring salvation to Gaebran Day.

422
00:21:10,040 --> 00:21:12,840
Fate drew your souls back together again.

423
00:21:13,300 --> 00:21:17,860
Of course, as with you, Seiya has no memory of your shared past life.

424
00:21:18,160 --> 00:21:23,920
But regardless, the extreme guilt and regret he felt on that day has been etched deep within his soul.

425
00:21:23,920 --> 00:21:27,760
When he was once again summoned as a hero, those impressions resurfaced.

426
00:21:28,220 --> 00:21:30,080
They were revealed in a single word.

427
00:21:30,940 --> 00:21:31,760
What do you mean?

428
00:21:31,840 --> 00:21:35,520
Do you remember when you were first getting acquainted, he used the word properties?

429
00:21:36,700 --> 00:21:37,380
Properties.

430
00:21:37,860 --> 00:21:39,800
Yeah, I thought he was just being difficult.

431
00:21:40,080 --> 00:21:42,120
I imagine it was largely subconscious.

432
00:21:42,600 --> 00:21:45,220
But this, this was the image in his mind's eye.

433
00:21:46,740 --> 00:21:48,080
So that means...

434
00:21:48,080 --> 00:21:49,280
Seiya is quite sharp.

435
00:21:49,280 --> 00:21:54,340
And from this small passage recorded here, it seems he was aware he'd been summoned once before.

436
00:21:54,720 --> 00:21:56,340
And of the tragic end he'd suffered.

437
00:21:56,600 --> 00:21:57,440
I have to go.

438
00:21:57,960 --> 00:21:59,360
Why would you leave right now?

439
00:21:59,460 --> 00:22:01,260
Obviously, because I need to help Seiya.

440
00:22:01,920 --> 00:22:03,600
Hold on, please don't go.

441
00:22:04,580 --> 00:22:07,580
Rista, I can't stomach the thought of losing you again.

442
00:22:09,380 --> 00:22:12,220
Although, I'm thankful for everything you've done for me.

443
00:22:12,880 --> 00:22:14,280
I can't stay here.

444
00:22:14,980 --> 00:22:15,280
But Rista...

445
00:22:16,000 --> 00:22:18,960
I can't sit back while Seiya puts himself in harm's way.

446
00:22:19,280 --> 00:22:27,700
At this point, the Demon Lord has the power to destroy gods, so I would not fault you for staying behind with us.

447
00:22:28,140 --> 00:22:30,180
In fact, I recommend you do stay behind.

448
00:22:30,720 --> 00:22:32,840
Seiya took measures to ensure your safety.

449
00:22:33,120 --> 00:22:34,020
That was his wish.

450
00:22:34,400 --> 00:22:35,380
Will you defy him?

451
00:22:35,940 --> 00:22:37,740
Yeah, you're damn right I will.

452
00:22:37,740 --> 00:22:45,660
This portal that you've opened leads to the Demon Lord's castle where the final battle awaits.

453
00:22:46,140 --> 00:22:49,500
You realize that by entering, you overstep your role of support goddess.

454
00:22:50,040 --> 00:22:50,780
I know that.

455
00:22:51,020 --> 00:22:52,340
I'll face those consequences.

456
00:22:52,340 --> 00:22:53,860
Rista!

457
00:22:54,020 --> 00:22:54,480
Wait up!

458
00:22:55,420 --> 00:22:57,720
There's no reason for you to risk your lives.

459
00:22:57,860 --> 00:23:02,160
So if you really want to go back to Gaya Brande, get Ishtar to send you when this is over.

460
00:23:02,400 --> 00:23:03,160
Don't be stupid!

461
00:23:03,600 --> 00:23:04,120
We're going!

462
00:23:04,180 --> 00:23:07,200
The only reason that we're still alive is because Seiya helped us out!

463
00:23:07,680 --> 00:23:09,160
So we're gonna help him!

464
00:23:09,620 --> 00:23:10,040
Really?

465
00:23:10,040 --> 00:23:13,340
I realize there's no point in trying to stop you.

466
00:23:13,760 --> 00:23:14,040
Yeah.

467
00:23:15,920 --> 00:23:18,100
All I ask is that you be careful.

468
00:23:18,540 --> 00:23:19,780
I'll do my best.

469
00:23:21,560 --> 00:23:22,620
Hold on, Seiya.

470
00:23:22,720 --> 00:23:23,340
I'm coming.

471
00:23:23,940 --> 00:23:25,680
I'm not sure I'll be able to save you.

472
00:23:26,040 --> 00:23:28,220
But I'm your friend, so I have to try.

473
00:23:29,320 --> 00:23:32,000
The least I can do is not let you die alone.

